WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
MuJoCo kinematic concept. The slot and tenon variants of a primitive TPMS block begin separated.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The tenon moves toward the slot in a prescribed horizontal approach while the camera reveals the geometry.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The two blocks hold a nominal adjacent alignment. Mating clearances and contact are not validated.
